  <!-- 1. CLAUDE CODE -->
  <section id="claude" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DCE3; border-radius: 24px; padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 40px); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 32px; align-items: flex-start">
  <div style="flex: 999 1 460px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px">
  <span style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: #FFC83D; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0">1</span>
  <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Claude Code</h2>
  </div>
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55; font-weight: 500">Claude Code runs on your computer and writes code for you. You describe what you want in plain words — it builds it.</p>
  <p lang="km" style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #2A2E37">Claude Code ដំណើរការលើកុំព្យូទ័ររបស់អ្នក ហើយសរសេរកូដជំនួសអ្នក។ អ្នកគ្រាន់តែពិពណ៌នាអ្វីដែលអ្នកចង់បានដោយពាក្យសាមញ្ញ — វានឹងបង្កើតវាឱ្យ។</p>
  <div style="background: #F3F4F6; border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; margin-top: 6px">
  <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #5B6170; letter-spacing: 0.08em">WHERE TO CLICK · ចុចត្រង់ណា</span>
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55">In the Claude app, the toggle at the <strong>top</strong> switches modes: <strong>Chat</strong> is the left button, <strong>Code</strong> is the right button.</p>
  <p lang="km" style="margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #2A2E37">នៅក្នុងកម្មវិធី Claude ប៊ូតុងនៅ<strong>ខាងលើ</strong>ប្រើសម្រាប់ប្តូររបៀប៖ <strong>Chat (ជជែក)</strong> នៅខាងឆ្វេង និង <strong>Code (កូដ)</strong> នៅខាងស្តាំ។</p>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div style="flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; max-width: 560px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px">
