  <div style="position: relative">
  <img loading="lazy" src="/cheatsheet/chat-toggle.webp" width="520" height="537" alt="Claude app with the Chat button selected, on the left of the top toggle" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid #D9DCE3; display: block">
  <span aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 67%; top: -1%; width: 19%; height: 16.5%; border: 4px solid #FF4D2E; border-radius: 50%; box-sizing: border-box"></span>
  </div>
  <figcaption style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600">Chat <span style="font-weight: 400; color: #5B6170">· left</span></figcaption>
  <figcaption lang="km" style="font-size: 13px; color: #5B6170; margin-top: -6px">ជជែក · ខាងឆ្វេង</figcaption>
  </figure>
  <figure style="margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
  <div style="position: relative">
  <img loading="lazy" src="/cheatsheet/code-toggle.webp" width="520" height="425" alt="Claude app with the Code button selected, on the right of the top toggle" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid #D9DCE3; display: block">
  <span aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 81%; top: -3%; width: 20%; height: 23%; border: 4px solid #FF4D2E; border-radius: 50%; box-sizing: border-box"></span>
  </div>
  <figcaption style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600">Code <span style="font-weight: 400; color: #5B6170">· right</span></figcaption>
  <figcaption lang="km" style="font-size: 13px; color: #5B6170; margin-top: -6px">កូដ · ខាងស្តាំ</figcaption>
  </figure>
  </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. GITHUB -->
  <section id="github" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DCE3; border-radius: 24px; padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 40px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px">
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; max-width: 820px">
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px">
  <span style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: #FFC83D; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0">2</span>
  <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em">GitHub &amp; git</h2>
  </div>
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55; font-weight: 500">GitHub stores your code on the internet, so you can open it from another computer or work together with other coders. <strong>git</strong> is the tool that sends your code there.</p>
  <p lang="km" style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #2A2E37">GitHub រក្សាទុកកូដរបស់អ្នកនៅលើអ៊ីនធឺណិត ដូច្នេះអ្នកអាចបើកវាពីកុំព្យូទ័រផ្សេង ឬសហការជាមួយអ្នកសរសេរកូដផ្សេងទៀតបាន។ <strong>git</strong> គឺជាឧបករណ៍ដែលបញ្ជូនកូដរបស់អ្នកទៅទីនោះ។</p>
  </div>
  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 12px">
  <div style="background: #F3F4F6; border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
  <span style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600">repository (repo)</span>
  <span style="font-size: 15px; color: #3F4553">Your project's folder on GitHub</span>
  <span lang="km" style="font-size: 15px; color: #3F4553">ថតគម្រោងរបស់អ្នកនៅលើ GitHub</span>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #F3F4F6; border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
  <span style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600">commit</span>
  <span style="font-size: 15px; color: #3F4553">A save point for your changes</span>
  <span lang="km" style="font-size: 15px; color: #3F4553">ចំណុចរក្សាទុកការកែប្រែរបស់អ្នក</span>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #F3F4F6; border-radius: 16px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
  <span style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 600">push</span>
  <span style="font-size: 15px; color: #3F4553">Upload your commits to GitHub</span>
  <span lang="km" style="font-size: 15px; color: #3F4553">បញ្ជូនការរក្សាទុករបស់អ្នកទៅ GitHub</span>
  </div>
  </div>
  <div style="border: 1px dashed #B9BEC9; border-radius: 16px; padding: 16px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px">
  <span style="font-size: 15px"><strong>Tip:</strong> you don't need to type git commands — just tell Claude: <span style="font-family: var(--mono); background: #F3F4F6; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 14px">commit and push my changes</span></span>
  <span lang="km" style="font-size: 15px; color: #3F4553"><strong>គន្លឹះ៖</strong> អ្នកមិនចាំបាច់វាយពាក្យបញ្ជា git ទេ — គ្រាន់តែប្រាប់ Claude ថា «commit and push my changes»</span>
  </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. CLOUDFLARE -->
  <section id="cloudflare" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid #D9DCE3; border-radius: 24px; padding: clamp(22px, 4vw, 40px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 26px">
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; max-width: 820px">
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px">
  <span style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; background: #FFC83D; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 800; font-size: 20px; flex-shrink: 0">3</span>
  <h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Cloudflare</h2>
  </div>
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.55; font-weight: 500">Cloudflare puts your code on the internet as a public website, with a free <strong>workers.dev</strong> address.</p>
  <p lang="km" style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; color: #2A2E37">Cloudflare ដាក់កូដរបស់អ្នកលើអ៊ីនធឺណិត ជាគេហទំព័រសាធារណៈ ដោយមានអាសយដ្ឋាន <strong>workers.dev</strong> ឥតគិតថ្លៃ។</p>
  </div>

  <!-- URL anatomy -->
  <div class="dark" style="background: #14161A; color: #FFFFFF; border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
  <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #C9CDD6; letter-spacing: 0.08em">YOUR WEBSITE ADDRESS · អាសយដ្ឋានគេហទំព័ររបស់អ្នក</span>
  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; gap: 4px; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: clamp(18px, 3vw, 28px); font-weight: 600">
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
  <span style="color: #FFC83D">my-site</span>
  <span style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #C9CDD6">project name</span>
  <span lang="km" style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: #C9CDD6">ឈ្មោះគម្រោង</span>
  </div>
  <span>.</span>
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
  <span style="color: #93C5FD">my-account</span>
  <span style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #C9CDD6">account name</span>
  <span lang="km" style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: #C9CDD6">ឈ្មោះគណនី</span>
  </div>
  <span>.</span>
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
  <span>workers.dev</span>
  <span style="font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #C9CDD6">free from Cloudflare</span>
  <span lang="km" style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: #C9CDD6">ឥតគិតថ្លៃពី Cloudflare</span>
  </div>
  </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Change account name -->
  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 22px; align-items: center; background: #F3F4F6; border-radius: 18px; padding: 22px">
  <div style="flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
  <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #5B6170; letter-spacing: 0.08em">CHANGE YOUR ACCOUNT NAME · ប្តូរឈ្មោះគណនី</span>
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5">Don't like <span style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 15px">my-account</span>? On the Workers &amp; Pages page, find <strong>Account details</strong> and click the <strong>pencil</strong> next to <strong>Subdomain</strong>. Note: this changes the address of every site on your account.</p>
  <p lang="km" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #3F4553">មិនចូលចិត្តឈ្មោះ <span style="font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 15px">my-account</span>? នៅលើទំព័រ Workers &amp; Pages រក <strong>Account details</strong> ហើយចុច<strong>រូបខ្មៅដៃ</strong>នៅជាប់ <strong>Subdomain</strong>។ ចំណាំ៖ វានឹងប្តូរអាសយដ្ឋានរបស់គេហទំព័រទាំងអស់ក្នុងគណនីរបស់អ្នក។</p>
  </div>
  <div style="flex: 1 1 320px; min-width: 0; max-width: 420px; position: relative">
  <img loading="lazy" src="/cheatsheet/cloudflare-subdomain.webp" width="700" height="297" alt="Cloudflare Account details card with the Subdomain field and its pencil edit icon" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; display: block">
  <span aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: 84%; top: 57%; width: 11%; height: 28%; border: 4px solid #FF4D2E; border-radius: 50%; box-sizing: border-box"></span>
  </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Steps -->
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">

  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 22px; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding-top: 22px">
  <div style="flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; display: flex; gap: 14px">
  <span style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid #14161A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; flex-shrink: 0">a</span>
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5">Open <strong>Workers &amp; Pages</strong> and click the blue <strong>Create application</strong> button.</p>
  <p lang="km" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #3F4553">បើក <strong>Workers &amp; Pages</strong> រួចចុចប៊ូតុងពណ៌ខៀវ <strong>Create application</strong>។</p>
  </div>
  </div>
  <img loading="lazy" src="/cheatsheet/cloudflare-create-app.webp" width="1000" height="205" alt="Workers and Pages screen with the Create application button" style="flex: 1 1 420px; min-width: 0; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #D9DCE3; display: block">
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 22px; align-items: center; border-top: 1px solid #E5E7EB; padding-top: 22px">
  <div style="flex: 1 1 340px; min-width: 0; display: flex; gap: 14px">
  <span style="width: 32px; height: 32px; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid #14161A; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; flex-shrink: 0">b</span>
  <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px">
  <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.5">Click <strong>Continue with GitHub</strong>, then pick your repository and deploy. Each time you push to GitHub, your site updates by itself.</p>
  <p lang="km" style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #3F4553">ចុច <strong>Continue with GitHub</strong> បន្ទាប់មកជ្រើសរើស repository របស់អ្នក ហើយ deploy។ រាល់ពេលអ្នក push ទៅ GitHub គេហទំព័ររបស់អ្នកនឹងធ្វើបច្ចុប្បន្នភាពដោយខ្លួនឯង។</p>
  </div>
  </div>
